  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is given below:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0016_db6152b181e6.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 143px;\"/></p><p>Graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is given below:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0016_1dfed6aff362.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 261px;\"/></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> and non-differentiable at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, number of points of discontinuity<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>Also, number of points of non-discontinuity<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
